# Scale-O Blog Paste Packs

Format: copy the latest paste pack in `docs/October/Blog/` (Shopify fields, 2 banner prompts, how to publish, article HTML, after publish, do not change).

## Primary keyword placement (exact phrase, not only variants)

| Place | Required |
|---|---|
| SEO title | Exact, at the front |
| Meta description | Exact, at the front (145 to 160 chars) |
| H1 | Exact or very close |
| First 100 words | Exact once |
| H2s | Exact in **at least 2** (one body H2 + FAQ H2) |
| Body paragraphs | Exact **3 to 4 times** spread across sections (e.g. buying/compare section, Why Scale-O, Next Step) |
| FAQ | One H3 question using it |
| Image ALT + excerpt | Exact |

Target: **6 to 8 primary mentions in the body** for a 3,000-word post. Read naturally, never stuff.

Secondary keywords: each one in at least one H2/H3 or FAQ question, plus once in body text.

## Content rules

- Body **3,000+ words**. Must include: before vs after table, benefits, Why Scale-O, Mini/Semi/Centi table, plans page and `/pages/book-trial` links.
- Scale-O = salt-free chelation tank insert, minimum 6-month life. Never claim it removes hardness, softens water, lowers TDS or strip readings, removes iron, purifies drinking water, cleans existing scale, or treats medical conditions.
- No em dashes. No invented prices (label any cost range "indicative").
- Link only live posts (check `https://scale-o.com/blogs/articles.atom`) or posts published earlier in the calendar. Never link rejected topics.

## Before finishing, run and report

1. Body word count (strip HTML) is 3,000+
2. Em dash count is 0
3. Exact primary keyword count in body is 6 to 8, and it is in the meta description
4. SEO title 45 to 60 chars, meta 145 to 160 chars
